The initial MCP adapter, Pi process/session manager, Tailscale publication code,
and lifecycle E2E were extracted from OpenOx (Apache-2.0):
https://github.com/ziyzhu/openox
Original implementation: commit 05ae1c7 (apps/cli/src/serve.ts,
apps/cli/src/serve/, and apps/cli/serve-e2e.ts).

Modified here to provide an independent launcher, optional Tailscale publication,
pi-mcp protocol identity, process-group cleanup, and standalone verification.

Pi is a separate project and is not bundled in this repository:
https://github.com/earendil-works/pi
